## .NET build output
bin/
obj/

## Local NuGet feed for pre-release SDK packages during dev.
## We vendor the published-but-not-yet-on-nuget.org WinMcp.ModuleSdk package
## here so CI (and contributors) can restore without depending on a private
## feed. Once the SDK lands on nuget.org, drop the negation and re-ignore
## the directory contents.
local-packages/*.nupkg
local-packages/*.snupkg
!local-packages/WinMcp.ModuleSdk.*.nupkg

*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/

## Single-file publish + release artifacts
src/**/publish/
*.exe
!app.manifest
WinMCP-v*.exe
WinMCP.exe

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/
packages/
# Vendored SDK package (see local-packages note above) — must come AFTER
# the blanket *.nupkg rule so the negation wins.
!local-packages/WinMcp.ModuleSdk.*.nupkg

## Test results
TestResults/
coverage*.xml
*.coverage

## IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Logs / local state
*.log
logs/
config.local.json
*.tmp
*.bak

## Misc
.env
.env.local
